      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "皆さん、お疲れ様です。仕事のオファーが\nきているので、確認していきましょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あら、ずいぶん来てるじゃない。……けど、\n彩宛てじゃなくて個人宛ての依頼が多いねぇ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "彩の皆さんはもともと有名人だったので、\n各々へのオファーは多いのですが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すみません。私の力不足で、\nなかなかユニットのお仕事に繋がらず……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーちゃんのせいじゃないさ。\nお仕事を頂けるだけでもありがたいことだよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "とはいえ、もうちょっとちょうちょさんや\nくろークンとお仕事をしてみたいでにゃんすねぇ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうですね……。\n他のみなさんの状況はどうなのでしょうか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "先日F-LAGSの皆さんが、\n歌番組に出演することになりましたよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そりゃ、めでたい！　切磋琢磨している仲間が、\n大きな仕事に出るのは嬉しいものね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "でも、ワガハイたちも負けてられないでにゃんす！\n彩でもっとてれびに出られるよう頑張るでにゃんす！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "猫柳さんの言う通りですね。\n今の私たちに悩む時間はありません。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "仲間と共に、そして夢を叶えるために。\n前進あるのみです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_d:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "数時間後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
